00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.950
Introducing Neo, our new approach to creating digital products for the AI era.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.300
We’ve always strived to create design systems that enhance customer experiences,

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:15.100
drive consistency and help our people work more efficiently.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.400
Neo goes further.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.100
It reimagines both the experiences our customers see

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.150
and the way we design and build at scale.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.400
Neo introduces a more expressive digital language.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.600
It retains the strongest elements of the Vodafone brand

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.350
while bringing greater depth, tactility and character

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.150
through light and shadow, texture and materiality.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:41.500
Familiar at its core, yet unmistakably more modern.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:47.100
From everyday journeys to new propositions and different brands,

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:53.500
Neo provides a single foundation from which we can create many different experiences.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.150
But the biggest change is beneath the surface.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.250
Neo has been designed for agentic development.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:05.000
Design, engineering and agents now work from the same shared foundation,

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.600
with components, standards,

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:15.050
tokens and technical decisions providing the context and guardrails

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.450
needed to build consistently across all platforms.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:22.700
That means faster development cycles, less rework

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.050
and consistently high quality from the outset.

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:28.500
Neo is more than a design system.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.150
It is an operating system for digital product development.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:35.000
Built faster, built consistently,

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.600
built for what comes now and what comes next.
